fpga-config-scrubber: the work of John Vrachnis on the Zynq-7000 two-dimensional
configuration-memory scrubber (MSc thesis, University of Piraeus).

Credits:
  - Architecture of the scrubber and the 2-D EDC algorithm: V. Vlagkoulis
    (SYSYFOS project, University of Piraeus). His RTL is NOT part of this
    repository and is NOT covered by this licence (see rtl/README.md).
  - Supervision: Prof. M. Psarakis, University of Piraeus.

Scope of this licence: the files in this repository authored by John Vrachnis.
Exceptions:
  - rtl/modules/icap_controller/icap_controller.vhd was written by J. Vrachnis
    within the SYSYFOS project and keeps its original header line
    "Copyright = University of Piraeus 2020". That notice is retained as found.
  - prototypes/2019_fault_injection_ip/Fault_Injection_v1_0*.vhd are based on
    the AMD/Xilinx Vivado AXI4-Lite peripheral template.

